WEBVTT

video-title-va-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Kukonzekera

va-01
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.100
Konzani matchati, tepi yoyezera, cholembera ndi pini yotetezeka yoboolera timabowo.

va-02
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:18.600
Yeseretsani wodwalayo ndi zilembo za E zoyang'ana mbali zosiyanasiyana musanayambe kuyeza. Mufunseni kuti aloze kumene E yayang'ana.

va-03
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:29.867
Kuwala kuwunikire pa tchati. Onetsetsani kuti sikuchokera kumbuyo kwa tchati.

va-04
00:00:29.867 --> 00:00:38.367
Onetsetsani kuti kuchokera m'maso mwa wodwala kufika pa tchati pali mamita atatu.

video-title-va-2
00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.867
Kuona zinthu zakutali

va-05
00:00:40.867 --> 00:00:45.867
Phimbani diso limodzi ndi chikhatho cha dzanja. Musagwiritse ntchito zala.

va-06
00:00:45.867 --> 00:00:52.867
Yambani ndi zilembo zazikulu kwambiri ndipo pitani pansi pa tchati.

va-07
00:00:52.867 --> 00:01:00.867
Lembani mtunda woyezera monga nambala yapamwamba ya muyeso wa Snellen. Apa ndi mamita atatu.

va-08
00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:16.100
Pemphani wodwala kuti aloze kumene E iliyonse yayang'ana. Pa diso lakumanzere gwiritsani zilembo za kumanzere, ndipo pa lakumanja zilembo za kumanja. Yambani ndi zazikulu.

va-09
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:28.100
Pitirizani mpaka wodwala asathenso kuzindikira zilembo molondola kapena amalize tchati.

va-10
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:37.100
Lembani mzere womaliza umene wodwalayo waona molondola wonse. Apa muyeso wake ndi zitatu pa khumi ndi zisanu ndi zinayi.

video-title-va-3
00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.600
Kuyeza ndi kabowo kakang'ono kapena magalasi

va-11
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:47.333
Ngati muyeso wa kuona ndi wochepera zitatu pa zitatu, bwerezani kuyeza pogwiritsa ntchito kabowo kakang'ono kapena magalasi.

va-12
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:53.400
Mungapange timabowo mwa kuboola ndi pini kumene kuli timadontho takuda pa khadi lowerengera pafupi.

va-13
00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:59.033
Ngati kuona kukuyenda bwino ndi timabowo kapena magalasi, wodwalayo akufunika magalasi.

video-title-va-4
00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:04.533
Kuona kochepa: zala, kusuntha kwa dzanja ndi kuwala

va-14
00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:13.900
Ngati E yaikulu kwambiri sikuoneka pa mamita atatu, yesani pa mita imodzi ndi theka. Ngati sikuonekabe, yesani kuwerenga zala.

va-15
00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:22.400
Funsani kuti ndi zala zingati zimene mwakweza. Lembani kuti wodwalayo akuwerenga zala ndi mtunda umene akuzionera.

va-16
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:33.400
Ngati wodwalayo sangathe kuwerenga zala, sunthani dzanja lanu ndipo funsani ngati akuona kusunthako. Lembani zotsatira ndi mtundawo.

va-17
00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:44.900
Ngati kusuntha kwa dzanja sikuoneka, yezani ngati wodwalayo angaone kuwala. Lembani ngati akuona kuwala kapena sakuona.

video-title-va-5
00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:50.400
Kuona zinthu zapafupi

va-18
00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:57.400
Poyesa kuona zinthu zapafupi, gwirani tchati chowerengera patali masentimita makumi anayi. Maso onse akhale otseguka.

va-19
00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:03.400
Pemphani wodwalayo kuti awerenge mokweza, kuyambira ndi zilembo zazikulu kwambiri.

va-20
00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:10.400
Lembani mzere wa zilembo zazing'ono kwambiri umene wawerengedwa mosavuta, ndi mtunda woyezera.

va-21
00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:18.400
Ngati kuwerenga n'kovuta, pemphani wodwala kuti azindikire zilembo kapena afanizire maonekedwe ake.

va-22
00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:26.400
Angaloze kumene E yayang'ana monga poyesa kuona patali, kapena angatsanzire kaonekedwe kake polemba m'mlengalenga ndi chala.

va-23
00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:34.400
Ngati kuona zinthu zapafupi kuli kochepera N12, bwerezani kuyeza ndi magalasi owerengera a mphamvu zosiyanasiyana.

va-24
00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:42.400
Ngati akuona bwino atavala magalasi, akufunika magalasi.
